# The .vscode folder contains launch configuration and tasks you configure in
# VS Code which you may wish to be included in version control, so this line
# is commented out by default.
#
# Di-ignore DI SINI dengan sengaja: launch.json menyimpan IP LAN server dev
# (API_BASE_URL) yang berbeda tiap mesin & sering berubah karena DHCP. Dengan
# tidak men-track-nya, IP tidak akan ke-reset saat merge antar branch.
